<p>The <strong class="selflink">Properties 2da</strong> defines core properties for the game.
</p><p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> is defined as an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2da" title="M2da (page does not exist)">m2da</a> in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a> and has an <b>ID</b> of <b>98</b>.  It can be extended by m2da fragments which have names starting with <b>properties</b>.  It has not been assigned a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_*</a> constant.
</p>
